@layout Legal.LegalMain
@page "/legal/refund"

<div class="lg:w-[70%] bg-surface-light dark:bg-surface-dark rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-xl shadow-amber-900/5 border border-amber-100 dark:border-amber-900/30 overflow-hidden relative">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 pattern-bg pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="p-8 lg:p-16 relative z-10 legal-content">
        <section>
            <div class="bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-900/20 p-6 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-primary mb-12">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2 text-primary">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined">summarize</span>
                    <span class="font-bold uppercase text-sm tracking-widest">TL;DR Summary</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-sm m-0 font-medium">
                    Because our cookies are perishable treats baked fresh for you, we generally don't accept returns.
                    However, if your order arrives damaged or isn't what you ordered, we'll make it right.
                    A happy pride is our top priority!
                </p>
            </div>

            <h2 class="mt-0">1. Perishable Goods Policy</h2>
            <p>
                Our cookies are handcrafted, artisanal products baked without preservatives. Due to their
                perishable nature, we cannot accept returns or exchanges if you simply change your mind
                or decide you prefer a different flavor after the tiger has left the kitchen.
            </p>

            <h2>2. Damaged or Incorrect Orders</h2>
            <div class="bg-amber-50/50 dark:bg-white/5 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-amber-100 dark:border-amber-800/30 mb-8">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-primary mb-2 font-bold italic">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">auto_awesome</span>
                    The Tiger's Guarantee
                </div>
                <p class="text-sm m-0 italic">
                    If your cookies arrive in a condition that is less than "roar-some" (damaged packaging or
                    incorrect items), please contact us within 24 hours of delivery. Include a photo of
                    the box and treats so our quality control team can investigate.
                </p>
            </div>

            <h2>3. Non-Refundable Situations</h2>
            <div class="bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-900/20 p-6 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-primary mb-8">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2 text-primary">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined">info</span>
                    <span class="font-bold uppercase text-sm tracking-widest">Crucial Note</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-sm m-0">
                    We cannot offer refunds for orders where the delivery address provided was incorrect,
                    or if the package was left unattended in heat/weather after a successful delivery.
                    Tigers are tough, but chocolate melts!
                </p>
            </div>

            <h2>4. Cancellations</h2>
            <p>
                Need to cancel? You can do so within 2 hours of placing your order. Once our bakers
                start crackin' eggs and melting chocolate, the order is locked in and cannot be cancelled
                or refunded.
            </p>

            <h2>5. Processing Your Refund</h2>
            <p>
                If a refund is approved, it will be processed back to your original payment method
                automatically. Please remember it can take 5-10 business days for your bank or
                credit card company to post the funds back to your account.
            </p>

            <h2>6. Shipping Costs</h2>
            <p>
                Shipping costs are non-refundable. If you receive a refund for a damaged order,
                the cost of the initial shipping will be deducted from your total refund amount
                unless the error was entirely on our end.
            </p>

            <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-amber-100 dark:border-amber-800/30 text-center">
                <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest opacity-50">End of Refund Policy</p>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>
</div>